# A backup holds a copy of .env — every provider credential this stack has —
# and a database dump containing every customer's name, phone number and
# address. Roadmap §66 says backups/ is for local development only and that
# production backups belong off-site; this is the part that makes "never
# committed" a property of the repository rather than a habit.
#
# Ignore everything, keep the directory.
*
!.gitignore
